cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MyUncleVision: a lattice-based framework for unsupervised anomaly discovery in images (computer-vision companion of MyUncle)"
abstract: "A Python framework for label-free discovery of unusual local organization in images and in lattices of embeddings: patch embeddings on a lattice, appearance rarity at several prevalence scales, lattice smoothing, ranked and explained regions; MyUncle order and entropy definitions generalized to d dimensions, with a bridge to MyUncle simulations. Evaluated on synthetic images and simulated lattices only."
